<http://data.silknow.org/object/c5196595-7c23-35d0-b769-31f1a95dfdc7/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Furnishing fabric of figured silk satin. With plain weave at the top and bottom and three colourways in emerald and olive green replacing the black, pink replacing the cream silk, and tried near the top.\n\nThe design in deep pink-red, black and cream is of interlocking rectangles, alternately with a cream ground with a bat, moon and star, or bird and sun, or red ground with a spray of flowers which overlaps the adjacent scenes."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/c5196595-7c23-35d0-b769-31f1a95dfdc7> .

